  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I remember seeing a post about this before and I could've sworn I saw it marked as completed but I just went on today to find that they are still there so guess not.\n\nThere should be an option remove the menus in the avatar and friends menu that suggests new avatars to try out and to find friends.\n\nIt's really annoying and feels like a major punch in the face in the friends one since it makes you feel like you don't have enough friends and in the avatar one like your own avatars aren't good enough.\n\nOn top of that an option to remove the public avatars in the avatar menu would also be nice. As a model maker I and I imagine many others would prefer to be able to only have the models we have uploaded in the avatar menu. Maybe an option in the settings for \"Show Personal Avatars Only\" or something like that.",
